{"html":"\u003c!doctype html\u003e\n\u003chtml lang=\"en-US\" dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\n\u003chead\u003e\n\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003ctitle\u003eReset your Regnovum password\u003c/title\u003e\n\u003c/head\u003e\n\u003cbody\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHi, Baseline Ana\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eUse the code below to reset your password. If you did not request this, ignore this message.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eReset code\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eB4SE-L1NE-00\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eThe Regnovum team\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003c/body\u003e\n\u003c/html\u003e\n","subject":"Reset your Regnovum password","text":"Hi, Baseline Ana\n\nUse the code below to reset your password. If you did not request this, ignore this message.\n\nReset code: B4SE-L1NE-00\n\nThe Regnovum team"}